   "id": "T1",
   "start": 14.516,
   "end": 19.355,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.572,
     "dur": 2.543,
     "text": "Riyadh's independent car market trades billions of riyals a year."
    },
    {
     "t": 3.434,
     "dur": 1.055,
     "text": "And no one had ever counted it."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "glitch"
  },
  {
   "id": "T2",
   "start": 19.355,
   "end": 29.032,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 1.677,
     "dur": 2.501,
     "text": "So we walked it. Door to door. Five hundred and twenty showrooms."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "punch"
  },
  {
   "id": "B2d",
   "start": 29.032,
   "end": 35.806,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.29,
     "dur": 2.254,
     "text": "We did not guess. We photographed the floors, and read the prices on the windscreens."
    },
    {
     "t": 2.787,
     "dur": 1.685,
     "text": "Stock, prices and presentation. All seen in person."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "flash"
  },
  {
   "id": "B2e",
   "start": 35.806,
   "end": 41.613,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.29,
     "dur": 2.05,
     "text": "Every showroom pinned at its coordinates, and logged on one master sheet."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "slice"
  },
  {
   "id": "B3",
   "start": 41.613,
   "end": 47.419,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.198,
     "dur": 2.115,
     "text": "Five hundred and twenty showrooms. Five hundred and fourteen, pinned on the map."
    },
    {
     "t": 2.532,
     "dur": 3.033,
     "text": "Thirty one thousand, eight hundred and sixty nine cars on the floor. Three point six billion riyals of stock."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "glitch"
  },
  {
   "id": "B4",
   "start": 47.419,
   "end": 52.258,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.177,
     "dur": 0.812,
     "text": "Twenty five owners opened their books."
    },
    {
     "t": 1.186,
     "dur": 3.437,
     "text": "Al Qaadiseeya alone sells an estimated fifteen point seven billion riyals of cars a year. And that is the conservative figure."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "punch"
  },
  {
   "id": "A2",
   "start": 52.258,
   "end": 59.032,
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 0.291,
     "dur": 2.111,
     "text": "When the finance is not there, the sale walks out of the door."
    },
    {
     "t": 2.726,
     "dur": 3.692,
     "text": "Owners told us: for every ten cars they sell, about four more ready buyers leave without one."
    }
   ],
   "tr": "slice"
  },
  {
   "id": "RLEAK",
   "start": 59.032,
   "end": 65.806,
   "lines": [
